WEBVTT

00:17.684 --> 00:19.269
THIS CRACKED ME UP
CHECK IT OUT

00:19.352 --> 00:20.770
POLITICIAN'S SON'S TRUE NATURE

00:22.689 --> 00:24.858
LOOK AT THEM LOL
HIDING BEHIND MONEY. GROSS.

00:24.941 --> 00:26.401
FORCING DRINKS. IS HE FOR REAL?

00:27.152 --> 00:28.278
SERVES THE BULLY RIGHT

00:28.361 --> 00:29.738
NICE ONE, ERPB
TOO MUCH THOUGH?

00:29.821 --> 00:31.156
HUH? I JUST FIND THEM COOL

00:31.239 --> 00:32.240
THEY'RE SO OVER THE TOP!

00:32.323 --> 00:33.199
I APPROVE OF THE ERPB

00:33.283 --> 00:35.243
Disband the ERPB
that violates student human rights

00:35.326 --> 00:37.037
through corporal punishment!

00:37.120 --> 00:39.080
Disband!

00:39.164 --> 00:41.916
No more student-abusing ERPB!

00:42.000 --> 00:44.044
No more!

00:44.127 --> 00:45.378
No more!

00:45.462 --> 00:47.839
They've reacted quicker than I expected.

00:47.922 --> 00:49.424
It's better this way.

00:49.507 --> 00:51.301
It's better to take the hit early.

00:51.885 --> 00:53.178
We expected this anyway.

00:53.261 --> 00:55.638
-Disband!
-The student-abusing…

00:55.722 --> 00:57.849
Even so, don't get caught on tape.

00:58.391 --> 01:01.936
But you said
you'd block all the bullets and missiles--

01:02.020 --> 01:05.231
I can block bullets and missiles,
but not videos.

01:06.024 --> 01:08.026
We have to file in the US
to take them down.

01:08.610 --> 01:09.778
Then I won't do anything.

01:09.861 --> 01:11.112
That's not what I mean…

01:11.196 --> 01:12.447
Disband!

01:12.530 --> 01:13.865
That was on purpose, right?

01:13.948 --> 01:15.325
-Yes.
-"Yes"?

01:16.618 --> 01:19.579
I should've crashed my car
into you back then.

01:19.662 --> 01:21.664
Don't be so childish.

01:21.748 --> 01:23.333
Provide solutions!

01:23.416 --> 01:25.043
You're lucky I'm busy.

01:25.126 --> 01:26.669
Of course. Here you go.

01:26.753 --> 01:29.089
Disband the ERPB
that violates student human rights…

01:29.172 --> 01:32.342
It's packed with reporters outside.
Are you off to take the hit?

01:32.425 --> 01:34.302
One who deserves it should take it.

01:34.928 --> 01:36.096
But that's not us.

01:37.013 --> 01:39.182
Minister, what exactly does the ERPB do?

01:39.265 --> 01:41.643
Did you propose
establishing the ERPB two years ago

01:41.726 --> 01:42.936
because of Jinwon High?

01:43.019 --> 01:45.271
Is allowing corporal punishment
the main focus?

01:45.355 --> 01:48.066
What about the statutory ban on it?
Will it be repealed?

01:48.149 --> 01:50.151
Some say you have reverted to a time

01:50.235 --> 01:52.529
when student human rights
were disregarded.

01:52.612 --> 01:54.823
Please share your view on this, Minister.

01:56.616 --> 01:57.450
Human rights?

02:01.079 --> 02:02.372
Did you say human rights?

02:03.665 --> 02:06.626
The Korean education system has failed.

02:06.709 --> 02:10.255
Children rely more on hagwon
than on schools.

02:10.338 --> 02:12.841
They respect
and listen to their teachers at hagwon

02:12.924 --> 02:15.009
more than their homeroom teachers
at school.

02:15.093 --> 02:19.013
Schools are now merely seen as
somewhere to complete the volunteer hours

02:19.097 --> 02:22.809
and performance assessments
required for college.

02:22.892 --> 02:26.146
Furthermore, aren't we seeing problems
like gambling, drugs,

02:26.229 --> 02:28.273
statutory rape, and even gangs

02:28.356 --> 02:32.026
emerging in schools
we have always claimed to be sacred?

02:32.110 --> 02:35.697
Children no longer respect their teachers,

02:35.780 --> 02:38.658
and teachers are afraid of the children.

02:38.741 --> 02:42.412
How can teachers teach properly
when their authority has been destroyed?

02:43.746 --> 02:45.206
Of course, this may not matter

02:45.290 --> 02:48.418
to children who have access
to hagwon and private tutoring.

02:48.501 --> 02:51.838
But there are also children
who rely solely on school lessons.

02:52.338 --> 02:54.007
Didn't we build our education system

02:54.090 --> 02:56.801
so that those children can learn
without any worry?

02:57.468 --> 03:00.555
Therefore, the ERPB
will use corporal punishment,

03:01.055 --> 03:02.891
and even go further if we must,

03:03.391 --> 03:05.977
in order to protect the right to learn.

03:12.192 --> 03:14.068
To those who disrupt learning,

03:14.777 --> 03:15.945
this is a warning.

03:16.738 --> 03:18.823
Don't get in the way
of compulsory education.

03:19.324 --> 03:22.952
The Educational Rights Protection Bureau
will not put up with it.

03:24.162 --> 03:27.040
"FIRM ACTION" DECLARED
AGAINST DISRUPTION TO EDUCATION

03:31.586 --> 03:34.047
We should give Minister Choi
an appreciation award

03:34.130 --> 03:35.298
on behalf of our party.

03:35.381 --> 03:38.384
Your archrival Ryu Gwang-pil
has been ousted thanks to him.

03:38.468 --> 03:39.969
Things are easier now.

03:40.053 --> 03:44.349
Was the ERPB establishment bill passed
two years ago?

03:44.432 --> 03:46.517
Yes, the ERPB bill was the bargaining chip

03:46.601 --> 03:49.229
they offered at the time
in return for their agreement

03:49.312 --> 03:53.233
to our party's proposal
to increase the prosecution special funds.

03:53.900 --> 03:58.154
So, ultimately, the ERPB
was a joint effort by our party, right?

03:58.238 --> 04:00.448
Choi Gang-seok isn't well-known at all,

04:00.531 --> 04:02.992
and the ERPB
will only be a flash in the pan.

04:03.076 --> 04:03.910
Exactly.

04:03.993 --> 04:07.247
They're saying they'll teach by beating.
The public won't stand for it.

04:07.330 --> 04:09.666
This is the country that grounds flights

04:09.749 --> 04:12.877
during the listening section
of the university entry exam.

04:13.503 --> 04:17.465
With education, people don't care
about politics, ideology, or status.

04:18.883 --> 04:21.761
The Minister of Education
is responsible for such education.

04:23.638 --> 04:27.517
There'll be no repercussions
if we nip problems in the bud early.

04:59.340 --> 05:01.384
GUUN HIGH-TECH HIGH SCHOOL

05:03.594 --> 05:05.388
RANKED IN THE TOP 3 THUG SCHOOLS

05:05.471 --> 05:06.973
TOP SCHOOL FOR NEXT-GEN GANGSTERS

05:07.056 --> 05:08.599
MOST-AVOIDED SCHOOL BY TEACHERS

05:08.683 --> 05:12.395
TEACH YOU A LESSON

05:14.022 --> 05:15.523
Hey, bastard!

05:22.280 --> 05:23.698
-Get out of the way!
-Move!

05:24.949 --> 05:26.075
Get lost, bastard!

05:26.159 --> 05:27.702
It's brand new. Damn.

05:27.785 --> 05:28.953
Hey, got a cig?

05:29.954 --> 05:30.955
What do you even have?

05:31.039 --> 05:32.123
-Hurry up!
-Coming.

05:33.458 --> 05:35.043
I didn't hold it there earlier.

05:37.295 --> 05:40.256
-I saw it, damn it.
-I said it wasn't me, asshole.

05:40.757 --> 05:43.051
-He hit him.
-No, not yet.

05:43.134 --> 05:43.968
Okay.

05:45.053 --> 05:47.722
Try it yourselves, guys.

05:49.182 --> 05:50.391
Hey.

05:51.267 --> 05:52.268
Hey!

05:52.935 --> 05:53.853
You were staring.

05:54.937 --> 05:56.814
No, I wasn't.

05:56.898 --> 05:58.191
Yes, you were.

05:59.359 --> 06:00.193
You want beef?

06:00.276 --> 06:02.779
No, I'm not that kind of student.

06:02.862 --> 06:03.696
Is that so?

06:05.698 --> 06:07.658
Hey, this is brand new.

06:08.242 --> 06:10.161
-You a new kid?
-Yeah.

06:10.912 --> 06:12.663
Did you know it's rough as fuck here?

06:12.747 --> 06:14.791
I did a little research.

06:14.874 --> 06:16.292
Want me to protect you?

06:18.086 --> 06:20.713
I'm not sure if you're the kind of kid

06:20.797 --> 06:23.758
I can count on for that yet.

06:23.841 --> 06:26.511
So many people these days
are just all talk.

06:27.303 --> 06:28.429
So I'll just show you.

06:28.513 --> 06:29.972
Here, protection fee!

06:37.438 --> 06:40.691
What an extremely
well-prepared loser you are.

06:43.569 --> 06:45.446
Wait. Do you think

06:46.781 --> 06:50.118
you could write me a receipt for that?

06:50.201 --> 06:51.369
-No, right?
-Not a chance.

06:51.452 --> 06:52.870
That's what I thought. Sorry.

06:55.873 --> 06:58.126
-Find the other one and put them on.
-Okay.

07:06.968 --> 07:07.969
Hello.

07:08.845 --> 07:11.806
I'm the transfer student. My name is

07:13.182 --> 07:14.517
Bong Geun-dae.

07:17.145 --> 07:18.813
Take the empty desk by the window.

07:20.523 --> 07:22.692
Don't fight, and try to get along.

07:24.652 --> 07:26.696
Books out, everyone.
Let's start the lesson.

07:28.531 --> 07:31.159
-I didn't bring my book.
-Share with your neighbor.

07:31.242 --> 07:32.577
-Don't have one either.
-Same.

07:32.660 --> 07:35.329
-Me too.
-You too.

07:37.415 --> 07:39.584
I'll just read it to you,
and we'll manage.

07:40.835 --> 07:41.919
You go make copies.

07:44.213 --> 07:45.506
"For us, please, sir."

07:48.634 --> 07:49.844
That would take longer.

07:53.139 --> 07:54.807
All the other teachers do it.

07:58.019 --> 07:59.103
Sir.

08:00.771 --> 08:03.107
Fine. I'll go make copies.

08:03.608 --> 08:04.650
Thanks.

08:12.325 --> 08:13.826
Guys, let's go farming.

08:14.577 --> 08:16.162
-Farming?
-Let's go!

08:19.290 --> 08:20.625
Hurry.

08:20.708 --> 08:23.211
Hey, Gwang-kki,
go bring that fucking rat over here.

08:23.294 --> 08:24.837
-Wait. But why?
-Get out here.

08:24.921 --> 08:25.963
-I'm not…
-Come on.

08:26.047 --> 08:26.881
Open.

08:34.055 --> 08:36.432
Guys, our lunch today

08:36.516 --> 08:38.476
is grilled Pikachu!

08:38.559 --> 08:40.269
Let's go!

08:41.354 --> 08:42.271
You teach design.

08:44.065 --> 08:45.358
Draw it in a designer style.

08:45.983 --> 08:47.276
We're in class right now.

08:47.902 --> 08:50.238
No one is paying attention
to class anyway.

08:50.321 --> 08:52.615
-See?
-I'm too sleepy for class.

08:52.698 --> 08:54.200
Damn it. Let go.

08:54.700 --> 08:56.285
I told you to let go. Okay?

08:56.869 --> 08:58.371
Pikachu!

08:59.455 --> 09:00.665
Damn it.

09:00.748 --> 09:02.458
-Fuck.
-What are you all doing?

09:02.542 --> 09:05.753
Miss, we're going to have
a joint class today.

09:05.836 --> 09:08.506
Fucking hell. Those fucking clunkers.

09:09.757 --> 09:12.134
Hey, a joint class sounds fun.

09:12.218 --> 09:13.886
Get out here, you fucking dumbass.

09:14.887 --> 09:16.597
-Hey, Jjik-sae.
-Yeah.

09:17.098 --> 09:18.474
Get some good footage.

09:18.558 --> 09:20.560
Okay. I'll make sure you look great.

09:29.277 --> 09:31.529
You piece of shit! Fuck!

09:42.415 --> 09:44.750
Fucking hell!
I told you to stay on me, asshole.

09:44.834 --> 09:45.835
Damn it.

09:47.420 --> 09:48.838
Fucking bastard!

09:55.761 --> 09:57.513
Go, electrical department!

10:00.558 --> 10:02.727
Are you here for a picnic? Fucking idiot!

10:08.733 --> 10:10.776
New kid! Are you here for a picnic too?

10:10.860 --> 10:12.028
No, I'm not.

10:12.111 --> 10:13.279
Get out here.

10:13.362 --> 10:15.531
Fuck. What the hell?

10:20.244 --> 10:21.412
You promised protection.

10:21.495 --> 10:23.372
You're that moron from earlier. Sorry.

10:29.670 --> 10:30.838
New kid, right?

10:31.339 --> 10:33.424
I'm Kim Hyeong-ju
from the same department.

10:34.133 --> 10:34.967
Hang on.

10:35.051 --> 10:37.762
-What's going on with them?
-They need to get recruited.

10:37.845 --> 10:38.679
What?

10:39.930 --> 10:42.725
That's Park Seong-hwan,
the top dog in the automobile department.

10:42.808 --> 10:44.852
-That guy with short hair?
-Yeah.

10:45.561 --> 10:46.896
Oh, that guy.

10:46.979 --> 10:47.855
Damn it!

10:48.356 --> 10:50.900
Cho In-beom's the top dog
in the electrical department.

10:52.276 --> 10:53.653
-The guy with long hair?
-Yeah.

10:54.362 --> 10:56.447
You need to be a good fighter
to be noticed.

10:56.530 --> 10:57.865
Only winners get recruited.

10:57.948 --> 10:59.283
Fuck you, you son of a bitch.

10:59.367 --> 11:01.744
But who are you being recruited by?

11:01.827 --> 11:03.037
BULLY HIERARCHY CHART

11:03.120 --> 11:06.832
This kid is Jang Gwon-hyeok,
the ultimate third-year top dog.

11:06.916 --> 11:10.127
He only comes to school
when he feels like it.

11:10.211 --> 11:12.755
He beats kids
and takes their money all the time.

11:12.838 --> 11:14.924
He gets into gang fights
with other schools.

11:15.007 --> 11:17.301
He just gives you a real headache.

11:17.802 --> 11:19.804
I shouldn't say this as an educator,

11:19.887 --> 11:22.390
but I just wish
he'd never come to school again.

11:22.473 --> 11:25.393
He's practically half gangster.

11:25.476 --> 11:28.979
He's been recruited even before graduating
and is already living that life.

11:29.063 --> 11:31.982
Here. See this? Take a look.

11:33.109 --> 11:36.195
He's got the expensive motorcycle,
the designer clothes,

11:36.278 --> 11:38.114
the hard liquor, and the tattoos.

11:38.948 --> 11:42.576
The kids say he's earning
tens of millions of won per month.

11:42.660 --> 11:44.203
Who'd want to study, then?

11:44.286 --> 11:47.081
They want Gwon-hyeok to notice them
and get recruited,

11:47.164 --> 11:49.375
so all they do is fight to death.

11:49.458 --> 11:51.085
ULTIMATE TOP DOG JANG GWON-HYEOK
TO WATCH OUT FOR

11:52.962 --> 11:55.047
-Just fucking die, you bastard.
-Fuck.

11:58.426 --> 11:59.927
Listen, you fucker.

12:00.678 --> 12:02.763
That trap of yours is always the problem.

12:03.597 --> 12:04.432
Wait. Shit!

12:04.515 --> 12:05.349
What? Damn it.

12:05.433 --> 12:06.809
-Oh fuck!
-What?

12:06.892 --> 12:08.686
Hey, Gwon-hyeok sent you a DM.

12:11.063 --> 12:12.314
LET'S HAVE AN INTERVIEW

12:13.524 --> 12:14.358
Shit!

12:14.442 --> 12:16.652
Hey! It's fucking Gwon-hyeok!

12:16.736 --> 12:18.696
He wants to interview me, you bastard!

12:20.656 --> 12:22.700
Fucking hell!

12:23.576 --> 12:26.287
Our teaching staff just can't handle them.

12:26.370 --> 12:29.331
That's why we contacted the ERPB.

12:30.541 --> 12:31.375
Anyway,

12:31.459 --> 12:34.295
when will the other inspectors arrive?

12:34.378 --> 12:37.465
-Should we set up a separate space?
-No, it's just me.

12:37.548 --> 12:39.884
You'll be on your own
with these violent kids?

12:40.634 --> 12:42.970
Even the PE teacher,
a former national judo athlete,

12:43.053 --> 12:45.931
has been absent for two months
since breaking up a fight

12:46.015 --> 12:47.433
and fracturing his collarbone.

12:47.516 --> 12:49.643
This goes beyond simple discipline.

12:49.727 --> 12:51.812
You need to wage war on crime.

12:51.896 --> 12:54.356
Is waging war really necessary?

12:54.440 --> 12:57.818
You'll be in big trouble
with that kind of complacent thinking.

12:57.902 --> 13:00.821
-You should consider it a real war and--
-Sir.

13:01.405 --> 13:02.782
If there's a war,

13:03.574 --> 13:05.034
people will actually die.

13:20.216 --> 13:21.467
Don't worry.

13:21.967 --> 13:25.638
The kids will all end up getting along
and enjoying their classes.

13:32.311 --> 13:33.354
Damn it.

13:36.232 --> 13:38.484
What a load of crap, you dumb shit.

13:38.567 --> 13:39.610
You ran away earlier.

13:40.569 --> 13:42.071
Why did you come to our school?

13:44.198 --> 13:47.159
I wanted to study vehicles and get a job.

13:47.243 --> 13:49.328
I'm trying to get a job too.

13:49.411 --> 13:51.705
Gwon-hyeok's like a big company
I want to get into,

13:52.248 --> 13:54.291
and fistfights make up our résumé.

14:05.970 --> 14:07.888
AUTOMOTIVE TECHNICIAN PRACTICAL TEST

14:10.724 --> 14:12.226
Come here.

14:12.309 --> 14:13.143
Hey, new kid.

14:13.227 --> 14:15.437
-Get over here, damn it!
-Come on.

14:15.521 --> 14:17.064
Get the hell out there.

14:17.147 --> 14:19.400
-But why?
-You can beat him, right?

14:21.527 --> 14:22.528
What?

14:22.611 --> 14:25.698
The moron who loses here…
will be the power gauge.

14:29.159 --> 14:32.079
Do you think I could maybe ask

14:32.830 --> 14:33.873
what that is?

14:34.748 --> 14:35.583
Are you curious?

14:37.710 --> 14:38.544
Then try losing.

14:39.712 --> 14:40.713
Fight.

14:44.633 --> 14:46.135
Do you both want to get thrashed?

14:46.886 --> 14:48.804
What? What are you doing?

14:48.888 --> 14:50.222
Hey, push him.

14:50.806 --> 14:51.807
Just hit me.

14:51.891 --> 14:52.975
Why are you doing this?

14:53.058 --> 14:54.310
It's how it is. Just do it.

14:54.393 --> 14:55.769
-Are you kissing?
-How can I?

14:55.853 --> 14:57.313
Or we'll both get it. Hit me.

14:57.813 --> 14:59.356
What's wrong with you?

15:02.276 --> 15:03.110
Are you okay?

15:05.696 --> 15:06.947
Listen carefully, guys.

15:07.031 --> 15:09.783
If we don't get on Gwon-hyeok's radar
this time either,

15:09.867 --> 15:11.410
we're completely done for.

15:11.493 --> 15:12.870
-Okay.
-Hey, gauge.

15:16.582 --> 15:18.000
You'd better gauge properly.

15:24.673 --> 15:28.010
You scored 92 points. Congratulations.
You must be an MMA fighter.

15:28.093 --> 15:29.970
You've improved. Go on the offensive.

15:30.054 --> 15:31.013
What's my score?

15:31.096 --> 15:32.598
Get out of the way.

15:35.184 --> 15:36.685
-Watch.
-You scored 95 points.

15:36.769 --> 15:38.854
Congratulations.
You're currently in the lead.

15:47.112 --> 15:48.405
Are you okay?

15:48.489 --> 15:50.616
I'm fine. No need for that.

15:50.699 --> 15:53.327
Here, hold on to this for now.

15:53.994 --> 15:56.288
Give me your bag.

15:56.372 --> 15:57.539
It's all right.

15:58.749 --> 15:59.875
You helped me too.

16:01.377 --> 16:02.211
Thanks.

16:02.962 --> 16:06.006
Where do you live?

16:09.593 --> 16:10.719
This is my place.

16:11.553 --> 16:12.680
I see. Oh, here.

16:13.764 --> 16:15.599
-Thanks.
-See you tomorrow.

16:16.100 --> 16:18.018
Do you want to come in for some ramyeon?

16:19.937 --> 16:22.815
I don't mean it like that.
I meant actual ramyeon.

16:22.898 --> 16:23.899
Right.

16:25.275 --> 16:26.360
Well…

16:27.569 --> 16:28.612
Sure.

16:28.696 --> 16:30.030
-Come on in.
-Okay.

16:31.031 --> 16:32.324
-Watch your step.
-Okay.

17:01.562 --> 17:02.479
Thanks.

17:03.439 --> 17:05.607
What made you come to our school?

17:05.691 --> 17:07.693
To go to university.

17:07.776 --> 17:11.030
Through the special admissions
for specialized high schools.

17:11.113 --> 17:13.032
Then try a different school.

17:14.116 --> 17:16.994
I'm sure you can
since you've only just transferred.

17:17.661 --> 17:21.331
Ask your parents
to send you to a different school.

17:21.832 --> 17:23.000
Thanks.

17:24.543 --> 17:25.919
What about you?

17:26.003 --> 17:29.006
I'd always thought
this school was my only hope,

17:29.089 --> 17:30.340
but that wasn't the case.

17:30.424 --> 17:31.759
I think it's too late now.

17:31.842 --> 17:33.927
There are options like the GED.

17:34.011 --> 17:37.014
You have to go to hagwon for the GED,
which costs a lot.

17:46.815 --> 17:47.941
Try the kimchi.

17:48.442 --> 17:51.070
My mom works at a restaurant
known for its tasty kimchi.

17:56.241 --> 17:57.076
That's my mom.

17:58.452 --> 17:59.661
Hyeong-ju, are you home?

18:02.081 --> 18:03.248
Hello.

18:03.332 --> 18:06.460
Oh my, Hyeong-ju brought a friend home.

18:07.836 --> 18:09.421
All you're having is ramyeon?

18:09.505 --> 18:12.007
Wait a minute,
and I'll fix you a proper meal.

18:12.091 --> 18:13.467
-No, Mom.
-I'm fine, ma'am.

18:13.550 --> 18:14.468
-It's okay.
-Wait…

18:15.219 --> 18:17.429
-Gosh, I smell bad, don't I?
-No…

18:17.513 --> 18:18.764
I'll wash up quickly.

18:18.847 --> 18:20.641
Just wait a moment.

18:42.079 --> 18:45.290
If you do this,
the newspaper absorbs all the moisture

18:45.374 --> 18:46.583
so it dries out faster.

18:46.667 --> 18:49.294
It's uncomfortable wearing wet shoes
in the morning.

18:58.637 --> 19:00.764
DEPARTMENT OF AUTOMOBILE

19:02.182 --> 19:03.600
I didn't hold it there earlier.

19:05.978 --> 19:07.771
-I saw it.
-One, two.

19:08.355 --> 19:09.898
-Three, four.
-He hit him.

19:09.982 --> 19:11.608
-Five.
-No, not yet.

19:13.735 --> 19:16.280
Try it yourselves, guys.

19:16.780 --> 19:19.116
Those thugs beat you up every day.

19:19.199 --> 19:21.577
Why do you make such an effort
to come to school?

19:22.077 --> 19:23.620
Because it's still school.

19:25.038 --> 19:26.290
Correct answer.

19:26.874 --> 19:27.708
Who are you?

19:30.085 --> 19:32.087
I'm an ERPB inspector.

19:32.171 --> 19:34.131
I did a little research on you.

19:34.214 --> 19:37.509
What? Shall I list some facts
about Kim Hyeong-ju?

19:37.593 --> 19:38.969
How do you know my name?

19:39.052 --> 19:39.887
Hey.

19:39.970 --> 19:42.014
I told you I did my research.

19:43.682 --> 19:45.517
Class is about to start. You should go.

19:47.603 --> 19:48.562
Don't worry.

19:48.645 --> 19:51.648
From now on, you'll get lessons
until you're sick of them.

19:52.232 --> 19:54.860
You've got this, Kim Hyeong-ju.

19:58.655 --> 20:00.949
What receipt?
You're getting mugged, dumbass.

20:01.033 --> 20:03.243
What a crazy bastard.

20:04.244 --> 20:06.330
Comfy, isn't it? Just stay there.

20:07.122 --> 20:07.956
Oh?

20:08.040 --> 20:09.958
-I saw it, damn it.
-It wasn't me, asshole.

20:10.042 --> 20:11.752
One Flew Over the Cuckoo's Nest.

20:13.212 --> 20:15.672
One Flew Over the Cuckoo's Nest.

20:15.756 --> 20:16.715
What's that?

20:16.798 --> 20:18.592
When I say "One flew over the nest,"

20:18.675 --> 20:21.345
you're supposed to go
"flutter, flutter," right?

20:21.428 --> 20:22.512
It's today's code.

20:22.596 --> 20:23.513
"Code"?

20:26.308 --> 20:27.142
Hey!

20:29.394 --> 20:32.689
I messaged it to you
along with a video of the victim.

20:35.776 --> 20:36.693
You must be

20:37.194 --> 20:38.528
Deputy Director Bong?

20:38.612 --> 20:39.738
Yes, sir.

20:39.821 --> 20:42.908
I sure recruited the right person.

20:47.454 --> 20:48.372
RÉSUMÉ
BONG GEUN-DAE

21:00.592 --> 21:01.426
Right.

21:02.010 --> 21:03.971
Look this way.

21:04.680 --> 21:06.640
Deputy Director, are you a good runner?

21:07.140 --> 21:08.517
Why are you taking a…

21:13.772 --> 21:15.691
Hey, you bastards!

21:25.534 --> 21:28.245
Hey, you thugs, hooligans,

21:28.328 --> 21:30.038
dipshit bastards!

21:31.248 --> 21:32.666
Take this!

21:34.710 --> 21:36.920
Look at your hair, you morons!

21:37.004 --> 21:39.423
You're seriously eating? Bastards!

21:40.465 --> 21:41.383
Hey.

21:41.466 --> 21:44.094
Whoever catches that fucker
gets 100,000 won. Get him.

21:44.177 --> 21:45.721
Wait, no!

21:48.140 --> 21:49.433
Oh no. I'm sorry.

21:49.516 --> 21:52.102
No, I mean, take this!

22:01.278 --> 22:03.155
Where did he go?

22:03.655 --> 22:06.450
Get your ass out here, you son of a bitch!

22:06.533 --> 22:07.909
Are you scared, you fucker?

22:07.993 --> 22:10.495
-Where are you, you fucking chicken?
-Fuck.

22:10.579 --> 22:12.539
Where are you? You fucking scared or what?

22:12.622 --> 22:13.874
-What the hell?
-What the…

22:14.374 --> 22:15.292
What's going on?

22:16.084 --> 22:16.918
What the hell?

22:17.502 --> 22:18.337
Who are you?

22:20.213 --> 22:21.214
Me?

22:22.215 --> 22:24.134
The ERPB inspector.

22:24.217 --> 22:25.844
The Educational Rights what?

22:25.927 --> 22:27.929
Protection Bureau.

22:28.013 --> 22:30.515
They apparently beat up
a few nerds from Daehan High.

22:30.599 --> 22:33.060
My goodness, there's hope for Guun High.

22:33.143 --> 22:34.978
Someone here is on top of things.

22:35.062 --> 22:36.104
That's a pass!

22:36.188 --> 22:37.064
Mister.

22:37.564 --> 22:39.900
That's nothing to be proud of around here.

22:39.983 --> 22:41.526
This place is savage.

22:41.610 --> 22:44.071
We don't hold back
for teachers or adults or anyone.

22:44.154 --> 22:45.906
That's good to hear.

22:46.531 --> 22:48.533
You're gaining points nicely.

22:49.117 --> 22:50.410
You think I'm joking.

22:52.329 --> 22:55.082
I'm just worried you'll get hurt
if I take things seriously.

22:55.665 --> 22:56.625
All right, guys.

22:56.708 --> 22:57.667
Take a seat.

22:57.751 --> 22:59.544
You can't be fucking serious.

22:59.628 --> 23:01.254
What are you doing, dumbass?

23:01.755 --> 23:03.173
I'm going to mess him up!

23:03.256 --> 23:04.383
No, I'm going to.

23:04.466 --> 23:06.134
You can't even fight for shit.

23:06.218 --> 23:07.135
What about the heat?

23:07.219 --> 23:11.515
Fuck, all they can do is expel me.
Life is all gas and no brakes anyway.

23:11.598 --> 23:13.225
I'll just go all in on Gwon-hyeok.

23:13.308 --> 23:14.559
You're all dreaming.

23:14.643 --> 23:17.396
Who said we'd let you drop out
on your own terms?

23:17.479 --> 23:18.939
That's up to me.

23:19.022 --> 23:21.024
No, it's not up to you.

23:21.108 --> 23:24.111
How much do you think it costs
to get you this far in schooling?

23:24.694 --> 23:27.030
It's at least 65 million won per person.

23:27.656 --> 23:32.077
Do you think all that precious tax money
was spent just to make thugs like you?

23:32.160 --> 23:34.246
No, of course not!

23:35.539 --> 23:37.749
So as for what you can do
on your terms here,

23:38.333 --> 23:39.459
you have three things.

23:40.335 --> 23:41.294
First.

23:42.754 --> 23:46.133
If you want to leave,
you cough up all that money before you go.

23:47.008 --> 23:47.968
Second.

23:48.844 --> 23:51.930
You knock me down
and proudly walk out of here.

23:52.013 --> 23:53.265
Third.

23:53.348 --> 23:54.182
I know!

23:54.808 --> 23:56.768
The second option. It's quick and easy.

23:56.852 --> 23:58.061
Automobile department!

23:58.895 --> 24:01.731
-Let's go.
-We'll get in on it too!

24:06.278 --> 24:07.737
Goodness me.

24:13.285 --> 24:14.744
Sit down, you punks.

24:42.814 --> 24:43.899
Stay still.

24:44.399 --> 24:46.693
You'll get hurt.
It'll poke your eye. Done!

24:52.908 --> 24:54.409
-I said go!
-Mess him up!

24:54.493 --> 24:55.535
What the… You brat!

24:55.619 --> 24:56.786
Damn it!

25:02.459 --> 25:04.336
Are you in or not?

25:05.170 --> 25:06.379
-Together. Go!
-Fuck!

25:13.386 --> 25:15.055
Has anyone not been hit?

25:15.555 --> 25:16.598
Who wants another go?

25:16.681 --> 25:17.641
Damn it!

25:18.225 --> 25:19.351
Die!

25:32.072 --> 25:33.782
Have you boxed before?

25:39.329 --> 25:40.580
I need to sit down.

25:42.624 --> 25:44.292
Goodness me.

25:44.376 --> 25:46.836
This is why you should listen
to the very end.

25:46.920 --> 25:48.547
Here's the third and final option.

25:49.297 --> 25:50.882
If the first two don't pan out,

25:51.383 --> 25:54.928
then just be grateful
and finish your education.

25:58.515 --> 26:00.392
Come on out now. Okay?

26:01.560 --> 26:02.811
Hey, my foot.

26:02.894 --> 26:04.479
Wake up at 6:00 a.m.

26:05.564 --> 26:07.190
Supplementary class at 7:00 a.m.

26:07.274 --> 26:10.277
After that, you have regular classes,

26:10.360 --> 26:12.362
followed by lunch, specialty classes,

26:12.445 --> 26:15.574
afternoon regular classes,
after-school specialty classes,

26:15.657 --> 26:18.827
and evening supplementary classes.

26:20.287 --> 26:23.039
Why are there so many damn classes, sir?

26:23.123 --> 26:26.376
Because you need to make up
for the classes you've missed.

26:26.459 --> 26:29.296
I'm going to make sure you punks make up

26:29.379 --> 26:31.798
for every single second
of your missed classes.

26:32.382 --> 26:34.593
I'll make sure
you meet your required attendance

26:34.676 --> 26:36.136
so you can graduate.

26:36.636 --> 26:40.307
How does that sound?
Isn't compulsory education just amazing?

26:41.725 --> 26:44.227
That's a wrap for orientation.

26:44.311 --> 26:46.980
I'll bring your teacher over,
so stay seated.

26:48.440 --> 26:49.649
This is the worst.

26:52.110 --> 26:53.236
Goddamn it!

27:05.165 --> 27:06.207
Why are you standing?

27:11.755 --> 27:14.466
Oh man, why the hell
do we have to teach in the gym?

27:15.842 --> 27:17.260
Welcome, sir.

27:17.344 --> 27:18.178
Thank you.

27:19.512 --> 27:20.430
Here you are.

27:24.309 --> 27:26.936
-They're zombies, thirsty for learning.
-Pardon?

27:29.314 --> 27:30.523
Go in. They won't bite.

27:31.399 --> 27:32.901
They're very obedient.

27:34.819 --> 27:37.614
Since this is a joint class
for Electrical and Automobile,

27:37.697 --> 27:40.450
we'll cover electric cars,
which applies to both departments.

27:41.076 --> 27:42.243
Shall we open our books?

27:42.327 --> 27:44.037
I don't have my book,

27:44.537 --> 27:45.372
sir.

27:45.455 --> 27:46.831
-I don't either.
-Me neither.

27:48.291 --> 27:51.419
We can't have class without textbooks.
Who has theirs?

27:55.256 --> 27:57.592
I have a feeling Hyeong-ju might have his.

27:58.093 --> 27:59.260
Should I make copies?

28:00.095 --> 28:02.305
Don't waste paper and power on these guys.

28:03.014 --> 28:05.809
All right, we will make our own textbooks.

28:07.310 --> 28:09.813
The Joseon Dynasty way.

28:16.611 --> 28:18.488
I'm starting the timer now.

28:19.489 --> 28:21.491
Copy down every single word.

28:21.991 --> 28:24.077
Oh no, what should I do?

28:25.036 --> 28:26.413
I have nothing to write with.

28:29.541 --> 28:31.459
Oh no, what should we do?

28:31.543 --> 28:34.587
You need a pen to take notes.
Can you use something else instead?

28:34.671 --> 28:35.505
I wonder.

28:38.925 --> 28:40.385
Oh yeah, your blood.

28:59.487 --> 29:00.363
Oh, wait.

29:00.447 --> 29:02.365
Who else doesn't have a pen?

29:02.449 --> 29:03.616
-Give me that.
-Anyone?

29:03.700 --> 29:04.826
That's mine, you jerk.

29:04.909 --> 29:06.536
Damn it, give that back to me.

29:06.619 --> 29:08.371
What's wrong? Don't you have pens?

29:13.376 --> 29:14.210
What?

29:15.628 --> 29:17.297
-What? Why?
-Fuck this!

29:19.048 --> 29:20.258
I said I was timing you.

29:20.341 --> 29:22.093
If you're not done, come on up!

29:24.971 --> 29:25.847
He yanked it again.

29:30.477 --> 29:32.353
I haven't hit you yet. Keep straight.

29:53.208 --> 29:54.292
Fuck!

29:57.629 --> 30:00.298
Why the hell do I have to take
this damn class?

30:01.216 --> 30:02.926
Just let the kids go already!

30:03.593 --> 30:05.637
The morons who want to take the class can!

30:05.720 --> 30:08.932
Why are you forcing it
when we don't want to?

30:09.015 --> 30:11.643
It won't help us one bit in life!

30:13.394 --> 30:15.772
Yes, that's a very good point.

30:16.940 --> 30:20.401
Then we'll only have classes
helpful to your lives from now on.

30:20.902 --> 30:24.489
When you suspect a brake problem,
you have to check four things.

30:24.572 --> 30:26.616
-First, ask yourself two questions.
-Hey.

30:26.699 --> 30:30.829
Is it an electrical issue,
or is it a mechanical issue?

30:30.912 --> 30:33.998
Electrical students,
examine the electrical circuit.

30:34.082 --> 30:35.333
Automobile students,

30:35.416 --> 30:38.753
inspect the brake pads
and brake fluid levels.

30:38.837 --> 30:41.047
-Yes, sir.
-Okay.

30:41.798 --> 30:43.132
You all heard, didn't you?

30:43.883 --> 30:47.220
Park Seong-hwan and Cho In-beom,
come up and fix the brakes.

30:47.303 --> 30:50.265
-Stop talking shit already.
-You think that's possible?

30:50.348 --> 30:51.432
You can't do it?

30:51.516 --> 30:53.101
No fucking shit.

30:53.184 --> 30:55.228
You said "fucking" again.

31:01.734 --> 31:03.403
-Want a punch?
-No, I'm going.

31:04.195 --> 31:05.947
Why do you keep using violence to…

31:06.698 --> 31:07.782
You should film this.

31:07.866 --> 31:09.534
-What are you doing?
-Damn it.

31:09.617 --> 31:11.578
-Hey, get out.
-Get out.

31:11.661 --> 31:13.830
-Get out.
-What are you doing?

31:24.340 --> 31:26.175
The seatbelt!

31:28.136 --> 31:29.971
The seatbelt. No!

31:31.139 --> 31:32.348
I'm scared!

31:37.020 --> 31:38.521
We're fucked!

31:44.193 --> 31:46.321
What are you doing?
Aren't the brakes faulty?

31:47.572 --> 31:49.032
-Stop!
-You were in class.

31:49.616 --> 31:51.659
And I told you to fix them earlier.

31:51.743 --> 31:52.869
Up ahead!

31:53.453 --> 31:55.872
-What's up ahead?
-We're all going to die!

32:32.742 --> 32:35.078
All right, here we go!

32:35.161 --> 32:36.287
Oh fuck!

32:46.339 --> 32:47.215
Fuck my life.

32:57.976 --> 32:59.519
-How is this possible?
-Yeah, how?

33:02.021 --> 33:02.897
Wow, damn.

33:02.981 --> 33:06.109
It's not for you to decide
whether a class is necessary.

33:07.068 --> 33:09.028
No class is ever unnecessary.

33:16.160 --> 33:17.954
Those fucking bastards.

33:27.505 --> 33:31.259
I looked into that ERPB inspector,
and it's really quite strange.

33:31.926 --> 33:34.762
There is only one word
in the "experience" section.

33:34.846 --> 33:36.014
"Classified."

33:36.097 --> 33:38.558
I formally got this
through the Intelligence Committee.

33:38.641 --> 33:41.102
How can this happen? This isn't a movie.

33:41.936 --> 33:45.189
Since you served as director
of the National Intelligence Service,

33:45.815 --> 33:50.820
I thought there might be a way for you
to find out more information about him.

33:58.202 --> 34:01.497
You need to open the brake fluid tank
and drain the existing fluid.

34:01.581 --> 34:03.750
Then fill it with new fluid
and check the level.

34:03.833 --> 34:05.585
You also have to check

34:05.668 --> 34:07.795
whether there is any air
in the brake system.

34:07.879 --> 34:10.298
Fucking hell.

34:10.381 --> 34:11.883
You think you're a teacher now?

34:11.966 --> 34:14.886
Does nothing scare you,
now that you've climbed the ladder?

34:14.969 --> 34:16.262
Fuck, you little…

34:20.767 --> 34:22.268
You don't ever learn, do you?

34:23.895 --> 34:25.396
Your body will though.

34:26.147 --> 34:29.108
The way I spoke was a bit condescending.

34:29.192 --> 34:31.611
They won't do it again. Right, guys?

34:31.694 --> 34:33.780
-Right.
-Yeah.

34:35.406 --> 34:38.451
Why were you backing them earlier?

34:38.534 --> 34:42.663
If something went wrong, I was worried
we might have to stop our classes.

34:43.539 --> 34:47.251
Every minute, every second matters to me.

34:49.754 --> 34:52.548
You told the inspector, didn't you?

34:53.132 --> 34:54.008
Thanks.

34:55.051 --> 34:57.762
Don't mention it. I'm just doing my job.

35:10.525 --> 35:12.819
We're fucked
if we miss the interview today.

35:12.902 --> 35:13.778
Come on, pull.

35:14.362 --> 35:15.863
Hey, I think it moved.

35:15.947 --> 35:16.781
It's not working.

35:16.864 --> 35:18.491
-Come on.
-Yes, it's working.

35:18.574 --> 35:20.701
Fuck, this isn't working.

35:24.288 --> 35:25.623
Motherfucker.

35:26.290 --> 35:28.918
New kid, you asshole. Come here.

35:29.001 --> 35:30.837
New kid, you little asshole.

35:31.420 --> 35:32.505
You've got cigs, right?

35:32.588 --> 35:33.548
Just let him go.

35:33.631 --> 35:34.715
Hey, he's got some.

35:34.799 --> 35:36.259
Look, this asshole vapes.

35:36.342 --> 35:37.385
Shit.

35:37.468 --> 35:38.636
What a savage asshole.

35:38.719 --> 35:40.721
This is a utility knife.

35:42.265 --> 35:43.850
Hey, give me that and grab him.

35:43.933 --> 35:44.851
What? Why?

35:44.934 --> 35:46.727
Hey, this actually works.

35:46.811 --> 35:47.937
I told you it would.

35:48.437 --> 35:49.272
Last one.

35:49.355 --> 35:50.189
Stop moving.

35:50.273 --> 35:52.191
-Fuck, stay still.
-You're almost there.

35:52.275 --> 35:53.151
I'm done.

35:53.734 --> 35:55.736
-Fucking hell.
-It fucking worked.

35:56.237 --> 35:58.030
-Hey, hold this.
-Okay.

35:58.531 --> 36:00.825
You go first, and then you go.

36:01.409 --> 36:02.410
Why am I going?

36:02.493 --> 36:04.537
Because you'll snitch to the ERPB.
Damn it.

36:06.497 --> 36:08.624
Hey, you came. Good luck.

36:08.708 --> 36:10.084
This is the last time.

36:10.168 --> 36:11.169
Thank you, boss!

36:13.421 --> 36:14.881
Fucking hell.

36:14.964 --> 36:17.008
-He's so damn cool.
-What's with your numbers?

36:17.091 --> 36:19.051
-Dig deep and go all out. Okay?
-Hold on.

36:19.135 --> 36:20.303
Yes, boss.

36:22.597 --> 36:25.016
-He's calling us.
-Hey, loser.

36:25.099 --> 36:26.684
Fucking hurry up.

36:29.854 --> 36:30.688
Two, three.

36:30.771 --> 36:32.315
-Good evening!
-Good evening!

36:32.398 --> 36:33.816
I'm Cho In-beom, Electrical!

36:33.900 --> 36:36.110
I'm Park Seong-hwan, 18, from Guun High!

36:36.861 --> 36:39.322
-Your name.
-I'm Bong Geun-dae.

36:39.405 --> 36:41.115
-It's an honor!
-It's an honor!

36:44.202 --> 36:45.745
I think I only told you to come.

36:46.329 --> 36:47.705
There's a problem at school.

36:55.796 --> 36:56.631
Cheers!

36:56.714 --> 36:58.883
Cheers!

37:02.511 --> 37:04.764
Let's all have a drink together.

37:04.847 --> 37:06.766
Come on!

37:07.850 --> 37:10.478
-Hey, come take a picture.
-Yes, sir.

37:15.691 --> 37:17.193
Hey, he's here.

37:17.276 --> 37:19.612
SELF-STUDY

37:19.695 --> 37:21.697
It's fun

37:22.490 --> 37:24.867
Self-study time

37:24.951 --> 37:27.954
Where did Park Seong-hwan, Cho In-beom,

37:28.579 --> 37:29.956
and Bong Geun-dae go?

37:30.790 --> 37:32.458
We're right here.

37:37.380 --> 37:39.507
-It's not…
-You little punks.

37:39.590 --> 37:42.843
Little rats, I told you to do self-study.

37:42.927 --> 37:45.096
Even you, Bong Geun-dae, little punk!

37:45.179 --> 37:46.013
No, not me.

37:46.514 --> 37:48.516
Sir, you're fucked now.

37:48.599 --> 37:50.559
You can try begging a little now.

37:50.643 --> 37:51.686
"He-he."

37:56.649 --> 37:59.527
What's going on?
Did you bring backup or something?

37:59.610 --> 38:00.528
Back there.

38:01.237 --> 38:02.697
It's Gwon-hyeok.

38:12.415 --> 38:13.374
That's Gwon-hyeok.

38:15.668 --> 38:17.128
This is sick. Seriously!

38:17.878 --> 38:19.046
These little punks.

38:23.509 --> 38:24.844
Good evening!

38:34.228 --> 38:35.604
-Wow.
-Good evening!

38:35.688 --> 38:37.732
-Good to see you!
-Good evening!

38:39.692 --> 38:41.110
Goodness me.

38:43.696 --> 38:46.032
Oh my, look at that cigarette.

38:46.657 --> 38:48.701
What shall we do about this?

38:49.410 --> 38:51.037
Didn't you hear?

38:51.120 --> 38:55.041
There's a hella scary guy here,
and he'll destroy anyone disrupting class.

38:58.377 --> 39:01.297
Are you sure about that? I'm quite strong.

39:02.256 --> 39:05.843
Is that right? I see.
A gangster high schooler.

39:06.344 --> 39:08.763
Let's see what you've got.
Can I get my hopes up?

39:13.225 --> 39:14.352
That damn bastard.

39:39.210 --> 39:40.711
Damn it.

39:58.979 --> 40:00.439
You're incredible, boss!

40:01.565 --> 40:04.235
I knew we could count on you, Gwon-hyeok!

40:04.735 --> 40:06.987
Gwon-hyeok!

40:07.071 --> 40:11.450
-I never doubted you.
-Gwon-hyeok!

40:13.828 --> 40:16.038
Listen carefully, you fucking bastards!

40:16.539 --> 40:17.832
From now on,

40:18.332 --> 40:21.252
no one's off the hook
from being beaten up by other schools!

40:21.335 --> 40:24.213
And anyone getting beaten up
by old farts like that bastard

40:24.296 --> 40:26.132
won't be off the hook either!

40:26.215 --> 40:27.675
If it gets bad, drop my name.

40:27.758 --> 40:32.054
If they still come at you even then,
I'll fucking kill them all.

40:34.640 --> 40:39.895
Gwon-hyeok!

40:39.979 --> 40:43.149
Gwon-hyeok!

40:43.232 --> 40:46.944
-Gwon-hyeok! What the…
-Gwon-hyeok!

40:47.027 --> 40:50.698
Gwon-hyeok!

40:50.781 --> 40:53.701
Why did you stop?
He said he won't let you off the hook.

40:53.784 --> 40:55.494
Jang Gwon-hyeok.

40:57.705 --> 40:59.623
Hey, what will it do?

41:00.124 --> 41:03.002
Jang Gwon-hyeok. What will your name do?

41:03.085 --> 41:06.297
Is it a fast track? A golden ticket?

41:07.131 --> 41:09.091
This is exactly why I said

41:09.633 --> 41:11.927
education is necessary.

41:12.011 --> 41:14.638
You look grown-up,
but your brain is still in diapers.

41:15.222 --> 41:18.767
Jang Gwon-hyeok, do you know
why I made you come all the way here?

41:19.268 --> 41:21.854
You're a learning aid for these guys.

41:22.438 --> 41:23.856
-What?
-Such big words…

41:23.939 --> 41:26.192
You want to call Jang Gwon-hyeok in?

41:27.943 --> 41:31.113
You have to pull the weeds out
by the roots so they don't grow back.

41:31.197 --> 41:33.407
But how will you bring him in?

41:33.491 --> 41:35.993
Well, those who act up,
thinking they've got backup,

41:37.411 --> 41:39.663
are bound to call for backup
if they get beaten.

41:41.916 --> 41:42.958
You damn…

41:47.004 --> 41:49.840
It clearly didn't click for you,
so you get a forehead flick.

41:59.892 --> 42:01.977
Are you all right?

42:05.314 --> 42:07.691
You're screwed now.

42:08.400 --> 42:09.902
My bros said they'd come

42:10.903 --> 42:12.154
to support me.

42:12.238 --> 42:15.574
Oh dear. You still don't get it, do you?

42:15.658 --> 42:17.034
I support you too, you punk.

42:18.202 --> 42:19.286
With this.

42:24.250 --> 42:27.211
Inspector Na Hwa-jin
had an impressive career.

42:27.711 --> 42:30.005
He was a captain in the special forces.

42:31.298 --> 42:34.051
Are you suggesting
a return to military training in schools?

42:35.970 --> 42:38.889
A time when students lived
under the boot of the military?

42:38.973 --> 42:40.391
That's unacceptable.

42:41.767 --> 42:45.980
Our party intends to mobilize
all our resources to disband the ERPB.

42:46.063 --> 42:48.315
The ERPB is an organization
that must disappear.

42:48.399 --> 42:50.192
What exactly is the problem?

42:51.318 --> 42:54.029
Is it because the inspector
is a former soldier?

42:54.113 --> 42:58.158
The intensity of school violence has
long surpassed what is tolerated.

42:58.242 --> 43:01.620
There are students
who are active gang members,

43:02.246 --> 43:04.290
and even gangs formed by students.

43:05.165 --> 43:08.877
In this climate, do you expect teachers
to fight back with nothing but pens?

43:09.920 --> 43:12.214
It's not students the ERPB is up against.

43:12.298 --> 43:14.341
It's monsters.

43:17.261 --> 43:18.262
A monster

43:19.638 --> 43:22.057
should be taken down by another monster.

43:25.477 --> 43:27.896
-Okay, let's go!
-Let's go.

43:27.980 --> 43:28.856
Is it one person?

43:28.939 --> 43:30.316
Hurry up!

43:30.399 --> 43:31.817
-Jump over!
-Stop!

43:39.199 --> 43:40.075
Your bros?

43:41.035 --> 43:42.036
Hey!

43:42.786 --> 43:44.872
You've made a real mess of things.

43:45.456 --> 43:46.415
Enough of that!

43:46.999 --> 43:49.585
Who here is a student? Hands up!

43:52.379 --> 43:54.840
None of you, right? I'm glad.

43:54.923 --> 43:57.009
Now I won't have to go easy on…

43:57.509 --> 43:59.011
What? When did you get there?

43:59.511 --> 44:01.013
Go farther that way.

44:01.096 --> 44:02.431
Even farther. Yeah.

44:04.516 --> 44:06.435
I won't have to go easy on you.

44:06.935 --> 44:08.395
Is that so?

44:08.896 --> 44:10.689
I'm so fucking scared.

44:12.650 --> 44:15.569
This is your first and final warning.

44:16.445 --> 44:19.198
A school is a place
where you have lessons.

44:19.281 --> 44:20.824
-What's going on?
-Be quiet.

44:21.408 --> 44:25.162
No one can enter except students
attending lessons and their teachers.

44:25.996 --> 44:29.291
The moment you take even one step in…

44:31.502 --> 44:34.546
you'll be at war with me.

44:34.630 --> 44:35.964
War?

44:36.048 --> 44:37.633
That's our specialty.

44:46.558 --> 44:48.394
Come here, you bastard!

46:25.574 --> 46:27.743
Please spare me!

46:28.243 --> 46:29.244
I'm sorry.

46:29.328 --> 46:30.829
Sir, I'm sorry.

46:31.330 --> 46:32.372
That's not it.

46:35.250 --> 46:37.586
In that case,

46:37.669 --> 46:39.213
I'll stop coming to school!

46:39.838 --> 46:40.798
I'll drop out.

46:40.881 --> 46:42.466
I said that's not it.

46:47.638 --> 46:48.806
Think about it.

46:49.723 --> 46:51.892
Who should you be apologizing to?

46:59.358 --> 47:01.777
-Hey.
-Hey.

47:01.860 --> 47:02.986
Hyeong-ju!

47:03.070 --> 47:05.781
Hyeong-ju, I'm sorry!

47:05.864 --> 47:07.449
Forgive me. Please?

47:07.533 --> 47:09.701
-Spare me!
-I'm sorry.

47:09.785 --> 47:12.371
-You've got to spare me.
-I'm fucking sorry!

47:12.454 --> 47:14.373
-Forgive us, or we're dead.
-It's okay.

47:14.456 --> 47:15.707
Honestly, it's okay.

47:16.208 --> 47:17.751
Don't do this. It's fine.

47:17.835 --> 47:20.337
No, please spare me. I'm really sorry.

47:27.469 --> 47:28.428
Hyeong-ju.

47:32.266 --> 47:33.600
Are you really okay?

47:57.958 --> 47:58.917
I'm sorry.

48:32.951 --> 48:34.870
If you don't want classes, don't come.

48:34.953 --> 48:37.581
If you don't want to study, then don't.
It's your life.

48:38.332 --> 48:39.166
But…

48:42.002 --> 48:43.629
don't get in someone else's way.

48:46.048 --> 48:49.676
Don't assume your minute
is the same as another person's.

48:50.969 --> 48:52.512
It may feel the same now…

48:58.477 --> 49:01.271
but later, it'll have made
decades of difference.

49:12.157 --> 49:13.200
Understood, you punks?

49:13.867 --> 49:14.701
Yes, sir!

49:15.702 --> 49:17.371
Why are you guys silent? Understood?

49:17.454 --> 49:18.580
Yes, sir!

49:33.470 --> 49:36.473
I will report
on the results of the ERPB's work.

49:37.307 --> 49:40.477
Through our inspector's efforts
at Guun High-Tech High School,

49:40.560 --> 49:43.897
the ERPB has resolved
violations of the right to learn.

49:43.981 --> 49:45.482
To prevent any recurrence,

49:45.565 --> 49:49.861
we will take the following actions
alongside related departments.

49:49.945 --> 49:50.779
TATTOO REMOVAL CLINIC

49:50.862 --> 49:54.241
From now on,
tattoos will be banned in all schools.

49:55.117 --> 49:57.285
If you move,
your bare skin will get burned.

49:58.495 --> 50:01.957
Motorcycles will be prohibited
on school grounds.

50:02.457 --> 50:05.544
YOU'LL BE A GREAT MECHANIC
YOUR FRIEND, GEUN-DAE

50:11.299 --> 50:13.427
Should a student join or attempt to join

50:13.510 --> 50:17.514
bullying gangs, school gangs,
or any organized crime groups,

50:17.597 --> 50:19.307
they will face adult charges

50:19.391 --> 50:21.935
and penalties under the law
on organized crime groups.

50:22.686 --> 50:27.357
Finally, we will work
with the Ministry of Justice and the MSIT

50:27.441 --> 50:30.360
to continuously take action on
millennial and Gen Z gangs

50:30.444 --> 50:33.030
that recruit members through social media.

50:33.530 --> 50:35.407
We at the ERPB

50:35.991 --> 50:39.661
will do our best to uphold
students' rights to compulsory education.

50:39.745 --> 50:40.579
Turn off the TV!

50:40.662 --> 50:41.705
Yes, sir.

50:41.788 --> 50:43.457
Oh wow!

50:43.540 --> 50:46.084
You walked out of there,
and now you're here.

50:47.377 --> 50:50.714
Minister, don't you think
you're on TV too much lately?

50:50.797 --> 50:52.549
Why? Do you want to be on it?

50:52.632 --> 50:55.469
That's not what I meant.
You just seem to be enjoying it.

50:55.552 --> 50:56.803
Am I not allowed to?

50:56.887 --> 50:58.180
Of course you are.

50:58.263 --> 51:01.058
Did you see that?
"Those who disrupt learning, listen up."

51:01.141 --> 51:03.643
"Don't get in the way
of compulsory education." So cool.

51:04.978 --> 51:08.940
May I interrupt your conversation
for a brief moment?

51:09.024 --> 51:09.858
What is it?

51:09.941 --> 51:13.945
While carrying out my duties recently,
I incurred a few expenses.

51:14.029 --> 51:15.906
Yes, you should claim expenses.

51:15.989 --> 51:17.115
What are they?

51:17.616 --> 51:19.493
I was mugged

51:20.619 --> 51:22.329
about three times in total.

51:22.412 --> 51:23.955
Oh, mugged?

51:24.664 --> 51:26.458
They took 40,000 won in cash

51:26.541 --> 51:29.795
and 500 won for premium coffee
at a vending machine.

51:29.878 --> 51:31.797
And outside the workshop,

51:31.880 --> 51:35.884
a pair of sneakers worth about 125,000 won
called Nike Air Force…

51:36.468 --> 51:39.596
Let's just say white Nike shoes
were taken from me.

51:39.679 --> 51:43.767
And I was microwaving
a 2,200-won Uiseong garlic sausage

51:43.850 --> 51:46.103
at the school snack bar,

51:46.186 --> 51:48.188
and that was taken too.

51:48.271 --> 51:51.775
So I ultimately spent 167,700 won

51:51.858 --> 51:53.944
from my personal funds.

51:54.027 --> 51:57.197
Would I be able to claim those?

51:57.781 --> 51:58.657
Sure.

51:59.407 --> 52:01.451
Was anything else taken?

52:01.535 --> 52:03.245
Well…

52:03.745 --> 52:05.247
MEDICAL BILLS…

52:05.330 --> 52:06.832
No, nothing else.

52:08.041 --> 52:10.210
I see. Go ahead and claim the expenses.

52:10.794 --> 52:11.920
Thank you, sir.

52:15.924 --> 52:17.300
Should I buy you a sausage?

52:18.135 --> 52:20.345
Pardon? No, sir.

52:20.428 --> 52:23.682
-It's fine.
-Have one of those Uiseong garlic things.

52:23.765 --> 52:24.766
-Go on.
-Hey.

52:25.517 --> 52:26.351
He's just a kid.

52:26.434 --> 52:29.020
-But he said he had it taken--
-That's enough.

55:16.938 --> 55:19.899
Subtitle translation by: Lisa Kim
